## v1.0.0

### P1: Performance & Load Testing (SHOULD HAVE)

### Problem
Production traffic may exceed testnet capacity. Load testing must verify performance targets.

### Work Required

| Task | Status | Owner |
|------|--------|-------|
| Load test blockchain node at target TPS | 🔴 Not started | QA |
| Load test bridge service at target transfer rate | 🔴 Not started | QA |
| Load test marketplace matching at target offer rate | 🔴 Not started | QA |
| Profile agent-coordinator under 1000 concurrent agents | 🔴 Not started | QA |
| Identify and fix N+1 queries | 🔴 Not started | Agent A |

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Blockchain node handles >1000 TPS (per v0.6.0 targets)
- [ ] Bridge handles >100 transfers/minute
- [ ] Marketplace matching <200ms at 10K offers
- [ ] No memory leaks over 24-hour run

